# Claude Code System Prompt Rules for Cadence

Whenever you are asked to design, build, modify, or debug any UI, HTML, or CSS styles in this repository, you MUST follow these instructions:

1. Read and strictly follow the StyleSeed design language rules specified in `docs/STYLESEED_FULL.md`.
2. Read and respect the responsive layout and interaction flow guidelines in `docs/UX_GUIDELINES.md`.
3. Before finishing your work, self-verify your UI changes using the Verification Checklist in `docs/UX_GUIDELINES.md`.

Always prioritize grayscale base layouts with a single primary accent color (`--primary`), maintain card-based content structures, ensure touch targets are at least 44×44px, and check for responsive viewport clipping on mobile screen dimensions (<= 600px).
